== The problem
Just making nodes work "up to AC" has lost the equational reasoning
required to properly handle AC.

We have an E-graph closed under congruence, but it's missing the desired equation.

We could add back saturation on the AC identities, but that unsolves the problem we
were trying to solve in the first place.


